      "id": "F1",
      "statement": "Run run:5ce89f521e5e is a bounded replay of 50,000 events (dataset sha256 5ce89f52…). All 3 of 3 jobs completed, clink exited with status 0, and the run was not cancelled. Parameters: fan-in needs at least 5 distinct senders within a 3,600,000 ms event-time window, and the onward-link gap limit is 1,800,000 ms. The graph holds 50,000 transfers, 12,072 accounts, 12,321 devices, 691 onward links and 6 fan-in alerts. Everything below holds only for this dataset as this run processed it.",
