      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "F2",
      "statement": "There are six fan-in alerts. Each one's contributing transfers come from distinct senders, one transfer per sender. (a) A-37573: window 1794823200000–1794826800000, 7 senders, 7 transfers, total 379,500. (b) A-85921: window 1794855600000–1794859200000, 6 senders, 6 transfers, total 15,000; every contributing transfer is 2,500. (c) A-10859: window 1794924000000–1794927600000, 6 senders, 6 transfers, total 204,000. (d) A-28137: window 1795003200000–1795006800000, 7 senders, 7 transfers, total 29,500. (e) A-83577: window 1795057200000–1795060800000, 8 senders, 8 transfers, total 174,500. (f) A-20636: window 1795190400000–1795194000000, 6 senders, 6 transfers, total 36,000. No sender contributes to more than one alert. No device was used by two or more of the contributing senders within any one alert.",
